namespace pdg { /**

\fn pdg::Sprite::onAnimationBlendComplete(func)

\ingroup Animation
\brief Register a callback function to be called when an animation blend or transition completes.

Filters pdg::eventType_SpriteAnimate for pdg::action_AnimationBlendComplete. The
callback receives a pdg::SpriteAnimateEvent. Covers pdg::Sprite::blendToAnimation()
and pdg::Sprite::transitionToAnimation(); enabling authored triggers is independent.

**/ }